<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We want you to be happy with what you buy. This policy explains when refunds apply.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Before work starts</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you cancel before we start work, which is usually before your brief is complete, you receive a full refund.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">After work starts</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you cancel after work has started, we refund the value of the work not yet done. Where deliverables are partly complete (for example, some links already placed), you receive those deliverables and a refund for the remainder.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">After delivery</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Delivered work is not refundable, except where we did not deliver what the package describes. In that case we will first fix or complete the delivery, and refund if we cannot.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Replacements</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Profile and citation links not live at delivery are replaced. Guest posts removed within 90 days of publication are replaced free of charge.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Search results</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Refunds are not available because rankings or traffic did not change, as these are not guaranteed (see our <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>).</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How to request a refund</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
